{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"nav","type":"text","text":"# 能力镜头覆盖与恢复｜流程子图\n模式所有权在 HeroComponent；类关系见 [[GGYGO_结构_相机.canvas|结构图]]，每帧求值见 [[GGYGO_流程_相机.canvas|主流程]]。","x":0,"y":0,"width":1710,"height":140,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"default","type":"text","text":"1. PawnData 提供 DefaultCameraMode。\n\n读取：HeroComponent::DetermineCameraMode → PawnData->DefaultCameraMode；这是覆盖列表为空时的回退类。","x":0,"y":392,"width":400,"height":230,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a","type":"text","text":"2. GA A 激活：以自己的 SpecHandle 登记模式 A，A 成为有效模式。\n\n调用：GA::SetCameraMode(A) → HeroComponent::SetAbilityCameraMode(A, SpecHandle_A)；登记所有权。","x":470,"y":392,"width":420,"height":230,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b","type":"text","text":"3. GA B 激活：以 B 的 SpecHandle 登记模式 B，B 暂时覆盖 A。\n\n调用：GA::SetCameraMode(B) → SetAbilityCameraMode(B, SpecHandle_B)；B 排在 A 前。","x":970,"y":392,"width":420,"height":230,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"bend","type":"text","text":"4A. B 结束：只移除 B 条目；A 仍有效则恢复 A。\n\n调用：GA_B::ClearCameraMode → HeroComponent::ClearAbilityCameraMode(SpecHandle_B)；下一帧 DetermineCameraMode 返回 A。","x":1470,"y":243,"width":420,"height":230,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"aend","type":"text","text":"4B. A 先结束：只移除 A 条目；B 不受影响。\n\n调用：GA_A::ClearCameraMode → ClearAbilityCameraMode(SpecHandle_A)；B 仍在列表中。","x":1470,"y":743,"width":420,"height":230,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"restore","type":"text","text":"5. 所有覆盖清空后，HeroComponent 再选 PawnData 默认模式；CameraModeStack 平滑混合。\n\n调用：DetermineCameraMode 返回 PawnData 默认类 → CameraComponent::UpdateCameraModes → Stack::PushCameraMode/ EvaluateStack。","x":970,"y":1080,"width":420,"height":230,"color":"1"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e1","fromNode":"default","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a","toSide":"left","label":"默认模式可用"},
		{"id":"e2","fromNode":"a","fromSide":"right","toNode":"b","toSide":"left","label":"后来的覆盖置顶"},
		{"id":"e3","fromNode":"b","fromSide":"right","toNode":"bend","toSide":"left","label":"B 先结束"},
		{"id":"e4","fromNode":"b","fromSide":"right","toNode":"aend","toSide":"left","label":"A 先结束"},
		{"id":"e5","fromNode":"bend","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"restore","toSide":"top","label":"A 也结束后"},
		{"id":"e6","fromNode":"aend","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"restore","toSide":"right","label":"B 也结束后"}
	]
}